---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — ChargeVia by Rangeway"
  description="How ChargeVia by Rangeway handles information shared through this website."
>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-page__inner">
      <a class="back-link" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">«</span> Back home</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">The small print</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="legal-page__intro">
        This is an informational website. It does not offer accounts or an email signup form.
      </p>

      <h2>When you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever information you choose to
        include. We use it to read your message, respond, and continue the conversation you
        started.
      </p>

      <h2>Website data</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, our hosting provider may process technical request data needed to
        deliver and protect the site, such as an IP address, browser information, and request
        time.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        To ask about information you have sent us, contact
        <a href="mailto:hello@chargevia.net">hello@chargevia.net</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-page__updated">Last updated: July 30, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
